  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Artisan Workshops - Potos - 2nd Phase</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">ASUR will improve the skills, earnings, self-esteem and cultural pride of indigenous weavers, embroiderers and silversmiths from five municipalities of the Potos region. The grantee will consolidate four weaving centers and offer training and technical assistance in product development and design, quality control, research, promotion, marketing and organization. ASUR will also renovate its Munaypata artisan production center in the city of Sucre to use as a central store and museum.</narrative>
  </description>
